 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf71"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf6t"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _11epkyf5d _11epkyfp"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf5h _11epkyfl _11epkyfm _9wqnzj0 _9wqnzj3 _9wqnzj5 _9wqnzj8"></span></span><h3 class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g3 _1yc463g1t _1yc463ga _18yaz4f4">What’s it like working at Qualita Indonesia?</h3><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfh9 _11epkyfgl _11epkyf6l _11epkyfhp _1qiobmr0"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g3 _1yc463g1p _1yc463g6 _18yaz4f4"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf55"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16" class="_1595km00 _11epkyf55 _11epkyf5d _145z38o0 _145z38o2 _145z38o3 _145z38o4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20a1 1 0 0 1-.895-.553l-2.183-4.369-4.37-2.183a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.79l4.37-2.183 2.183-4.37c.34-.677 1.45-.677 1.79 0l2.183 4.37 4.37 2.183a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.79l-4.37 2.183-2.183 4.37A1 1 0 0 1 12 20Zm-4.764-8 2.878 1.438c.194.097.35.254.448.448L12 16.764l1.438-2.878c.097-.194.254-.35.448-.448L16.764 12l-2.878-1.438a1.001 1.001 0 0 1-.448-.448L12 7.236l-1.438 2.878c-.097.194-.254.35-.448.448L7.236 12Zm2.431-2.333h.01-.01ZM3.985 3.912l1-2 1 2 2 1-2 1-1 2-1-2-2-1 2-1Z"></path></svg></span>AI summary of recent reviews</span><div class="_1595km00" aria-label="Info" tabindex="0" aria-describedby="tooltip-ai-gen-summary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16" class="_1595km00 _1yc463g1p _11epkyf4x _145z38oa _1gs5prx0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 1C5.935 1 1 5.935 1 12s4.935 11 11 11 11-4.935 11-11S18.065 1 12 1Zm0 20c-4.963 0-9-4.037-9-9s4.037-9 9-9 9 4.037 9 9-4.037 9-9 9Z"></path><path d="M12 10h-2v2h1v6h2v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1Zm.38-3.92a1 1 0 0 0-.76 0c-.12.05-.23.12-.33.21-.18.19-.29.45-.29.71 0 .07.01.13.02.2.01.06.03.12.06.18.02.06.05.12.09.18l.12.15c.1.09.21.16.33.21.12.06.25.08.38.08s.26-.02.38-.08c.13-.05.23-.12.33-.21.04-.05.09-.1.12-.15.04-.06.07-.12.09-.18.03-.06.05-.12.06-.18.02-.07.02-.13.02-.2 0-.26-.1-.52-.29-.71-.1-.09-.2-.16-.33-.21Z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="_1595km00"><span class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463g1 _1yc463g1t _1yc463g8 _18yaz4f4"><p>Employees at Qualita Indonesia appreciate the <strong>timely payment of salaries and bonuses</strong>, which reflects the company's commitment to meeting its financial obligations. The <strong>strong team culture and supportive leadership</strong> create a family-like atmosphere where colleagues help one another, and supervisors provide valuable guidance to technicians. Staff also value the <strong>learning opportunities</strong> in banking technology and ATM maintenance, as well as the <strong>structured processes</strong> provided through ISO certification and clear SOPs.<br><br>However, there are some potential challenges to consider. The <strong>24/7 standby requirement</strong> can make work-life balance difficult, particularly for field technicians who need to be available at all times. Some employees mention that <strong>career progression</strong> may be influenced by internal dynamics, and <strong>transport allowances for field work</strong> may not fully cover the extensive travel demands between cities. The role also involves <strong>high-pressure situations with demanding targets</strong>, and the <strong>flexible but unpredictable schedule</strong> can make personal planning challenging as technicians must respond to issues as they arise.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf8t _11epkyf85"><h3 class="_1595km00 _11epkyf4x _1yc463g0 _1yc463gh _1yc463gm _18yaz4f4 _1yc463g1t">Recent reviews</h3></div><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf59 _11epkyfhh _11epkyf6t"><div class="_1595km00" id="review-card-0"><div class="_1595km00 _11epkyf8p _11epkyf7l _11epkyfax _11epkyf9t _11epkyf5d _11epkyf69 _11epkyfi9 _11epkyf4j _11epkyf4c _1yc463g10 _1yc463