ocation\":\"Jakarta\",\"salarySummary\":\"Average\",\"recommended\":{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2Recommended\",\"description\":\"Recommended\",\"value\":true},\"hasBeenFlagged\":false,\"ratings\":[{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":4,\"description\":\"Benefits \u0026 perks\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":3,\"description\":\"Career development\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":4,\"description\":\"Work/Life balance\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":4,\"description\":\"Working environment\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":4,\"description\":\"Management\"}]},{\"schemaVersion\":\"1.0.0\",\"title\":\"Sangat melelahkan sekali untuk Posisi Teknisi EDC\",\"createdAt\":\"10 Jun 2022\",\"pros\":\"Klaim Bonus Perjalanan Dinas dengan jarak tempuh diatas 50 KM (luar kota)\",\"cons\":\"Karena teknisi EDC menangani daerah dalam 1 kota bahkan 2 kota sekaligus, fisik dan mental sangat terkuras di jalanan. tidak ada transport harian, sangat berbanding terbalik dengan benefit yang di dapatkan oleh karyawan. transport pribadi dan uang saku BBM pribadi. jatuhnya merugi kerja hanya dapat lelahnya saja, belum resiko di jalan raya.\",\"overallRating\":3,\"id\":\"168711900368253\",\"companyId\":\"168558220684386\",\"jobTitle\":\"Field engineer\",\"employmentStatus\":\"Less than 1 year in the role, former employee\",\"workLocation\":\"Banyuwangi East Java\",\"salarySummary\":\"Average\",\"recommended\":{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2Recommended\",\"description\":\"Not recommended\",\"value\":false},\"hasBeenFlagged\":false,\"ratings\":[{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":3,\"description\":\"Benefits \u0026 perks\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":3,\"description\":\"Career development\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":3,\"description\":\"Work/Life balance\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":2,\"description\":\"Working environment\"},{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewV2RatingItem\",\"value\":2,\"description\":\"Management\"}]}],\"paging\":{\"page\":1,\"perPage\":3,\"total\":21,\"totalPages\":7}},\"companyReviewsAISummary\":{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewsAISummary\",\"reviewsCount\":22,\"reviewsDateFrom\":\"2017-01-06T02:23:59.712Z\",\"reviewsDateTo\":\"2023-07-13T03:49:26.000Z\",\"aISummaryContent\":{\"__typename\":\"CompanyReviewAISummaryContent\",\"positiveAndChallengesSummary\":\"Employees at Qualita Indonesia appreciate the \u003cstrong\u003etimely payment of salaries and bonuses\u003c/strong\u003e, which reflects the company's commitment to meeting its financial obligations. The \u003cstrong\u003estrong team culture and supportive leadership\u003c/strong\u003e create a family-like atmosphere where colleagues help one another, and supervisors provide valuable guidance to technicians. Staff also value the \u003cstrong\u003elearning opportunities\u003c/strong\u003e in banking technology and ATM maintenance, as well as the \u003cstrong\u003estructured processes\u003c/strong\u003e provided through ISO certification and clear SOPs.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHowever, there are some potential challenges to consider. The \u003cstrong\u003e24/7 standby requirement\u003c/strong\u003e can make work-life balance difficult, particularly for field technicians who need to be available at all times. Some employees mention that \u003cstrong\u003ecareer progression\u003c/strong\u003e may be influenced by internal dynamics, and \u003cstrong\u003etransport allowances for field work\u003c/strong\u003e may not fully cover the extensive travel demands between cities. The role also involves \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-pressure situations with demanding targets\u003c/strong\u003e, and the \u003cstrong\u003eflexible but unpredictable schedule\u003c/strong\u003e can make personal planning challenging as technicians must respond to issues as they arise.\"}},\"shouldI